Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.09,0:02:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stupid Daru...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.51,0:02:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}spreading our secrets to outsiders...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.84,0:02:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.43,0:02:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why must you take it that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.22,0:02:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.85,0:02:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not what I meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.64,0:02:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.08,0:03:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.75,0:03:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.34,0:03:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like I was crying, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.88,0:03:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You were clearly crying...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.51,0:03:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your eyes are still red.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.05,0:03:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.64,0:03:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's in my eye...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.76,0:03:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this, an old soap opera?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.89,0:03:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm not crying,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.27,0:03:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,so no questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.81,0:03:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.85,0:03:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.82,0:03:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.84,0:03:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Cristin—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.25,0:03:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!{muttered} Don't talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.22,0:04:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just say this...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.10,0:04:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're an important ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.47,0:04:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Any time you want to talk, I'll listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.06,0:04:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.77,0:04:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as planned, she fell for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.48,0:04:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can use her for all the grunt work!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.15,0:04:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.12,0:04:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.37,0:04:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.66,0:04:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you heading to Kyouma's?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.58,0:04:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he wanted me to bring lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.88,0:04:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, have you seen the time machine, Mayushii?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.84,0:04:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Time...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.30,0:04:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the PhoneWave?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.51,0:04:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,PhoneWave?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.93,0:04:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There's this big sparky thing, and it's kind of scary...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.23,0:04:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.64,0:04:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a time machine out of the movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.98,0:04:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.86,0:04:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But Mayushii doesn't really want him doing that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.03,0:05:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.24,0:05:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like Okarin is leaving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We will now begin our Round—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.66,0:05:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin! Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.33,0:05:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.08,0:05:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.42,0:05:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii says she isn't cosplaying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.21,0:05:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.34,0:05:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's her school uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.09,0:05:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I had school today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.80,0:05:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a super-realistic portrayal of a school uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.56,0:05:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's sexual harassment, and she doesn't have to put up with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.43,0:05:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's yours, Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.23,0:05:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.14,0:05:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait. I said we're having a Round Table!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.15,0:05:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who wanted me to bring lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.11,0:05:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.65,0:05:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously, it isn't anything important.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.65,0:05:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You can say that after you hear the discussion topic...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.74,0:05:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Physical time travel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.62,0:05:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri, is there still barley tea in the fridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.62,0:05:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,One second.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.42,0:05:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Realistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.34,0:05:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.42,0:06:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The Organization has initiated an operation to tear apart the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.88,0:06:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hououin Kyouma's words, my words,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.09,0:06:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,fail to reach them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.14,0:06:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Do they ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.47,0:06:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why are you ignoring my awesome topic?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.10,0:06:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.23,0:06:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We can send messages to the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.31,0:06:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be possible...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.06,0:06:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.56,0:06:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We can send 36 bytes plus some extra.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.23,0:06:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Three messages, each with six characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.03,0:06:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.07,0:06:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to experiment, why not be the guinea pig?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.70,0:06:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's if you don't mind ending up as a gel-Okarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.16,0:06:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Gel-Okarin, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.95,0:06:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That'd really hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.66,0:06:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN's experiments demonstrate the difficulties
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.92,0:06:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,inherent to physical time travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.71,0:06:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Even using the LHC, the largest particle accelerator in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.09,0:06:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,they've had no success.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.09,0:06:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't possibly do it with this equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.01,0:06:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how do the messages get to the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.60,0:06:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.85,0:06:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.43,0:06:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,As I said before,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.85,0:06:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN's trying to use the lifter-black hole combination
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.23,0:06:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,to achieve time travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.73,0:06:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The PhoneWave probably works on the same principle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.36,0:07:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But the microwave doesn't have anything
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.78,0:07:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,to function as a lifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.49,0:07:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.49,0:07:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.99,0:07:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're limited in the times we can send D-Mail too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.28,0:07:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Currently, we can't be sure that this machine
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.91,0:07:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,really sends messages to the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.21,0:07:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we continue,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.58,0:07:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,we should deal with more relevant issues first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.13,0:07:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Boring!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.50,0:07:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,99.9% of science is boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.88,0:07:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If you call yourself a scientist...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.84,0:07:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a scientist!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.30,0:07:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a mad scientist!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.60,0:07:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy is hopeless. Better do something quick.{TL: "this guy is hopeless, i have to do something soon."}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.27,0:07:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Makise...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.10,0:07:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.98,0:07:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.90,0:07:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Not another word!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.15,0:07:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back on topic already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.24,0:07:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Continuing on to the reports,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.61,0:07:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,how's the translation of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.11,0:07:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN's server documents going, Christina?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.87,0:07:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Or should I say, @channeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.74,0:07:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you that's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.54,0:07:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you sure know your memes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.00,0:07:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.75,0:08:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to report.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.05,0:08:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.96,0:08:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Continue your investigations...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.09,0:08:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,@channeler!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.68,0:08:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop calling me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.68,0:08:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru's up next. How's the hacking coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.10,0:08:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No change.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.05,0:08:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Until I analyze the mysterious program
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.89,0:08:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,on the other server, there'll probably be no change.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.23,0:08:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How's the IBN 5100 analysis going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.15,0:08:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be great if I could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.40,0:08:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.90,0:08:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.23,0:08:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't started the analysis?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.28,0:08:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How would I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.49,0:08:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the IBN 5100?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.24,0:08:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How would I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.16,0:08:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.67,0:08:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.96,0:08:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Christina...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.30,0:08:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,did I, by any chance, fail to find the IBN 5100?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.55,0:08:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even know where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.19,0:09:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.48,0:09:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So if I choose to believe what you say, you found the IBN 5100.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.65,0:09:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.65,0:09:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I carried it back here with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.16,0:09:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're the only one with any memory of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.16,0:09:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The D-Mails probably changed the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.04,0:09:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Changed the past...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.71,0:09:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But we've only sent minor stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.42,0:09:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the butterfly effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.05,0:09:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sending one message into the past
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.22,0:09:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,causes the worldline to split,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.59,0:09:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,from a world where we didn't buy a LOTO SIX ticket
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.81,0:09:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,to one where we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.10,0:09:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Little by little, this changes what was meant to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.35,0:09:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,One change causes another,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.94,0:09:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and they pile on top of one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.86,0:09:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one of the long-recognized risks of altering the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.86,0:09:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Then where is the IBN 5100?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.91,0:09:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me ask this instead:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.33,0:09:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,where was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.83,0:10:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, when I asked my dad, he said it used to be here, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.13,0:10:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.96,0:10:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.34,0:10:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.18,0:10:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There was an IBN 5100 at Yanabayashi Shrine,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.43,0:10:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.98,0:10:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No one knows when it was taken or by whom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.69,0:10:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,A dead end, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.86,0:10:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's strange to donate a PC to a shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.73,0:10:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder who would do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.91,0:10:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.91,0:10:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.46,0:10:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the list of ten questions I wrote
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.50,0:10:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,to ask the maids at the next event.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.13,0:10:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.50,0:10:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,"If you could go back and redo one thing from your past, what would it be?"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.26,0:10:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you do, Faris?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.76,0:11:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me think...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.35,0:11:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris... doesn't look back on her past! Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.93,0:11:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the task of the cat-eared maid,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.94,0:11:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,who brings everyone happiness, to forge ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.19,0:11:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.07,0:11:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, this is Faris.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.20,0:11:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouma.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.70,0:11:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A PC?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.20,0:11:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,An IBN 5100.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Did your family give it to Yanabayashi Shrine?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.91,0:11:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.71,0:11:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're right. My daddy did have a lot of old PCs.{*/a/ says this line is wrong, apparently.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.34,0:11:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouma...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.93,0:11:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,is this related to the time machine
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.47,0:11:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,you were talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.06,0:11:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.10,0:11:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an Upa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.81,0:11:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A metal Upa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.40,0:11:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you still want a metal Upa?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.90,0:11:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Still?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.78,0:12:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How long are you going to stand there staring at it? Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.24,0:12:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.45,0:12:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.95,0:12:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.54,0:12:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you buy now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.92,0:12:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I found a limited-edition that sold out before I could buy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.26,0:12:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,As you might say,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.97,0:12:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,"This encounter was the choice of Steins Gate!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.09,0:12:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't use it for stuff like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.97,0:12:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, why are you two following me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.77,0:12:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You could've stayed back at the lab with the assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.31,0:12:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I heard you were going to Faris's place,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.10,0:12:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to come along!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.31,0:12:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to go and play too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.32,0:12:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did Faris tell me to come to her house?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.49,0:12:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kirari!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.61,0:12:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri, wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.99,0:12:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.83,0:12:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The IBN 5100.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.96,0:12:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Shining Finger!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.22,0:13:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.81,0:13:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Shining...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.93,0:13:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Moeka!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.85,0:13:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiryu Moeka!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.99,0:13:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.25,0:13:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,FB said it was there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.21,0:13:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.79,0:13:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Back there, you mentioned the IBN 5100...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.09,0:13:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know where it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.51,0:13:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know either?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.68,0:13:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.61,0:13:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.99,0:14:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Moeka?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.74,0:14:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.36,0:14:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.95,0:14:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Moeka's so pretty and stylish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.16,0:14:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'd make a great cosplayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.71,0:14:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri, you know Shining Finger?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.46,0:14:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.92,0:14:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.76,0:14:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.63,0:14:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You brought her to the lab!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.72,0:14:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After Moeka sent her D-Mail,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.43,0:14:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}she disappeared from everyone's memory.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.98,0:14:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And then, after Luka sent his D-Mail,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.19,0:14:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}they knew her again.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.36,0:14:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Little by little, the world changes{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.90,0:14:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}each time a D-Mail is sent to the past then?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.29,0:15:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this really the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.42,0:15:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.55,0:15:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems it's on the top floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.73,0:15:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The mistress will be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.77,0:15:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.82,0:15:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Butler cafés aren't my thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.16,0:15:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,A real butler!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.61,0:15:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.37,0:15:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.08,0:15:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone looks like ants!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.46,0:15:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.08,0:15:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.29,0:15:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Figures he'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.09,0:15:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.96,0:15:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.13,0:15:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's Faris wearing her normal clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.59,0:15:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.97,0:15:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris NyanNyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.64,0:15:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems I must question your true identity!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.64,0:15:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.11,0:16:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,...Faris, nyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.32,0:16:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop fooling around!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.98,0:16:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If you refuse to explain, then I'm leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.65,0:16:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.45,0:16:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris's family owns all the land around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Akiba is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.83,0:16:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.04,0:16:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Akiba now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.33,0:16:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Faris's real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.21,0:16:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Akiha Rumiho!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.46,0:16:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't hear that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.22,0:16:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris's real name is Faris!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.80,0:16:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What a sad attempt to escape reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.18,0:16:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Faris was the one
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.06,0:16:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,who asked to bring the culture of moe to Akiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.73,0:16:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.73,0:16:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And she works as an angel at MayQueen
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.48,0:16:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,to further spread the culture of moe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.02,0:16:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How splendid!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.48,0:16:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And my eyes are also splendid for recognizing her before anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.32,0:16:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But, but... keep it a secret, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.70,0:16:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to treat me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.08,0:16:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,with Faris-love, just like you always have!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.12,0:16:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I will! Totally!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.08,0:16:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, nyan-nyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.46,0:17:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No nyan-nyans!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.75,0:17:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, what about the IBN 5100?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.42,0:17:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.67,0:17:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But before that, I have a simple request...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.38,0:17:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to arrange a trade?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.51,0:17:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.72,0:17:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I only want you to let me use the D-Mail, just once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.64,0:17:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.14,0:17:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Use it as much as you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.35,0:17:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! The D-Mail is absolutely off-limits to outsiders...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.69,0:17:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why not make Faris a lab mem too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.44,0:17:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.70,0:17:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sending more messages to the past would be—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.24,0:17:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who sent the LOTO SIX number back to try and make money,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.12,0:17:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,yet you won't send one for Faris?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.79,0:17:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Just this once!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.21,0:17:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.83,0:17:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But if I stop now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.92,0:17:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}there's no guarantee that the IBN 5100 will return.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.59,0:17:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If this is any indication...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.68,0:17:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.76,0:17:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But as Mayuri said,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.76,0:17:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll have to become a lab mem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.81,0:18:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You are now Lab Mem 007, Akiha Ru—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.10,0:18:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I-I can't hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.61,0:18:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.74,0:18:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sure you want to send it back ten years, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.66,0:18:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.37,0:18:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.45,0:18:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... it's a secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.70,0:18:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.79,0:18:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,As leader of the lab, it's my job to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.33,0:18:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No. A maiden's private life is off-limits to guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.46,0:18:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's wrong to look at someone's emails.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.34,0:18:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree! Totally!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.84,0:18:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.85,0:18:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then put your hand on the send button and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.65,0:18:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hallo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.52,0:18:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.02,0:18:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.69,0:18:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She hung up on me, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I bet she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.15,0:18:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That Christina!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.36,0:18:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't she know she's my assistant?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.20,0:18:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hallo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.87,0:19:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Hououin Kyouma. Don't just hang up on me without a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.29,0:19:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hououin? Oh, Okabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.16,0:19:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it was a prank call.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.00,0:19:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you saw my number on the display.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.63,0:19:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, those first words
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.42,0:19:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,were creepy enough to make me hang up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.59,0:19:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, you are terrified of the mighty Hououin Kyouma—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.93,0:19:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She hung up on me! She hung up on me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.06,0:19:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin, aren't you ready yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.60,0:19:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.48,0:19:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you, cold-blooded pervert girl genius...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.98,0:19:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hallo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.40,0:19:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, the Zomb—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.45,0:19:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hallo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.28,0:19:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, my name is Okabe Rintaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.24,0:19:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.49,0:19:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I would be eternally grateful
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.62,0:19:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,if you'd set the PhoneWave (name subject to change)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.33,0:19:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,to the values I proferred in my earlier message.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.59,0:19:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have just said that from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.34,0:19:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, that isn't what "proffer" means.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.05,0:19:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're embarrassing yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.59,0:20:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And stop calling it the PhoneWave (name subject to change) already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.51,0:20:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Celeb Sev!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.22,0:20:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to be polite, and you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.93,0:20:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Do they not like each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.81,0:20:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.69,0:20:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.23,0:20:15.19,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\frz342.44\blur0.75\pos(784.5,223.5)}Will you send?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.73,0:20:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.49,0:20:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I don't need to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.45,0:20:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.45,0:20:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The electricity's started.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.78,0:20:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Send it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.39,0:20:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.10,0:20:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.56,0:20:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.23,0:20:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,"Daddy"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.07,0:20:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you talking to Kyouma?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.07,0:20:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.40,0:21:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.32,0:21:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.45,0:21:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris's dad has this
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.12,0:21:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,kind of refined air about him, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.83,0:21:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed! You can tell he's Faris's dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.13,0:21:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.13,0:21:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know anything about an IBN 5100?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.97,0:21:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't heard that name in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.14,0:21:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.47,0:21:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I parted with mine a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.18,0:21:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you give it to Yanabayashi Shrine?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.35,0:21:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Shrine?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.36,0:21:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.27,0:21:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.12,0:21:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Before Faris sent her D-Mail,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.00,0:21:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I heard that the IBN 5100 disappeared after it had been given to Yanabayashi Shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.63,0:21:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But now, the shrine never got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.30,0:22:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Each time we send a message, things change.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.39,0:22:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Something may be changing,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.76,0:22:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}even without me being aware of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.82,0:22:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's possible that we've already done something that can't be undone.
