Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.54,0:22:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Kouga Yui?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.79,0:22:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakano's far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.96,0:22:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.21,0:22:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish there was a Toranoana comic shop here.
